4.5.dev3\n- Not reproducible in: 4.4.1.stable\n- git bisect identified 9b6d92723d (#104872) as the first bad commit.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev3.mono - macOS Sequoia (15.4.1) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 Max (Apple7) - Apple M1 Max (10 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAfter upgrading my project to v4.5.dev3.mono and testing it, I encountered issues with font rendering.\n\nWorking (e2b6a45e8):\n<img width=\"1052\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2d5197bf-e4e6-4c5f-8928-b2c5ae8b4bc5\" />\nBroken (9b6d92723d):\n<img width=\"1026\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47d9af0c-afda-480f-bde5-97693eedada8\" />\nStill reproducd in the latest master (67c96c8):\n<img width=\"1014\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/766b0dee-692c-4026-a06e-45ead69f3a94\" />\n\nIt was difficult to reproduce these issues by creating a new project from scratch, so I've created a Minimal Reproduction Project (MRP) based on my existing project.\n\nSpecifically, the problems observed are:\n- The outlines of TrueType fonts have become excessively thin.\n- Bitmap fonts are rendering significantly smaller than they should.\n\nI performed a git bisect to identify the relevant commits:\n- Last known good commit: e2b6a45e8\n- First bad commit (where both issues started appearing simultaneously): 9b6d92723d\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe issues were observed on Label nodes configured with both TTF and Bitmap fonts. Attempts to reproduce the issue from scratch were unsuccessful; the MRP had to be created by upgrading a project originally made in a previous version.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[font-issue-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19943103/font-issue-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":""